  "ruleText": "Saf-C 522.04 Fees. Multi-use decal plate fees shall be as outlined in RSA 261-B:4 for passenger or RV decal plates, in addition to fees outlined in RSA 261.\n\nSource. #12914, eff 11-6-19; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 523.04)",
